# Getscreen.me

> Getscreen.me is a cross-platform remote desktop and remote support platform for secure access to computers and mobile devices from a web browser or desktop application. It is designed for IT administration, technical support, remote work, device management, and integration of remote access into third-party products.

Getscreen.me provides cloud-based and Self-Hosted remote access solutions for individuals, IT teams, service providers, software companies, and enterprises.

Core connection scenarios include Permanent Access for unattended device management and Quick Support for on-demand attended remote support.

